    "idea": "Astonishing 3-car rooftop archipelago: use your brand-new Coupler Hook to yank coupling gangplanks across speeding void gaps, dodge a sweeping tunnel arch, swat Smelter Wasps, and uncouple BOTH the Mail Hatch (moth_6_06 in r2) and Caboose Hatch (Cycle 1 to r1)!",
